### Example Code

```python
from fastapi import APIRouter, FastAPI
from pydantic.types import UUID4
from pydantic import BaseModel
import json

class MyModel(BaseModel):
    id: UUID4
    name: str


app = FastAPI()
router = APIRouter()
@router.get("/items/{item_id}")
def read_item(item_id: UUID4) -> MyModel:
    return MyModel(id=item_id, name="Item Name")

app.include_router(router, prefix="/api/v1")

print(json.dumps(app.openapi(), indent=2))
```


### Description

Please see the OpenAPI spec (or execute the minimal code above).
<details>
<summary>Generated OpenAPI specs</summary>

